Paul Mathews (paul@gwoptics.Colorado.EDU) wrote:
:     I have a ring of polymorph and polymorph control and want to try
: the old leprechaun trick on a priest to decrease my AC.  I ahve never
: used these rings so my question is - When I polymorph back into a
: human (Wizard), do I end up with the same stats, level,etc. as before
: and if not how can I do this?  Never having done this I don't even
: know how the ring of polymorph control prompts me.  Thanks a million
: in advance!!!!!!

You are in good position to kick some butt with those two rings.  Put
both of them on, and then just walk around, rest, or anything to pass
time.  Soon you will be prompted.  Be sure you spell things correctly.
If you goof up and you polymorph into something too large you will burst
out of your armor.

Try becoming a nymph, and try and steal the Priest's other items.  They
usually carry two spell books, some holy water and some other stuff.
Just a suggestion.

